   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"11\">\n  <li>The height of a plant in mm is 7. It doubles each week. <strong>Select two</strong> expressions that represent the height of the plant, in mm, after 4 weeks.</li>\n</ol>\n<ol type=\"a\">\n  <li><span data-math=\"7+4 \\cdot 2\">7+4 \\cdot 2</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"7 \\cdot 2^4\">7 \\cdot 2^4</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"2+7^4\">2+7^4</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"7 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2\">7 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"7 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 4\">7 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 4</span></li>\n</ol>",
